        145.50927734375,
        545.76953125,
        158.7994384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "us ﬁrst prove that if ν ≥ν∗, then M ⊆H. First, note that:",
      "bbox": [
        306.71978759765625,
        156.42919921875,
        544.9296264648438,
        169.7193603515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ω⊤ρ ≤ν∗= sup",
      "bbox": [
        360.2398986816406,
        184.60939025878906,
        430.20928955078125,
        196.4105224609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
