        406.1922607421875,
        452.5115966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "s.t. ν ≥ω⊤x, ∀x ∈X,",
      "bbox": [
        385.8005676269531,
        453.88909912109375,
        487.199951171875,
        465.8101501464844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(29)",
      "bbox": [
        529.2005004882812,
        452.8288269042969,
        545.9581298828125,
        466.1189880371094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "which is also a semi-inﬁnite linear program (i.e., ﬁnite num-",
      "bbox": [
        306.72052001953125,
        473.94873046875,
        545.9580688476562,
        487.2388916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ber of decision variables (ν) but inﬁnite number of con-",
      "bbox": [
        306.72052001953125,
        484.8686218261719,
        545.9578857421875,
        498.1587829589844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "straints). A solution ν is feasible for Problem (29) provided",
      "bbox": [
        306.720458984375,
        495.9088134765625,
        546.0620727539062,
        509.198974609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that:",
      "bbox": [
        306.720458984375,
        506.82867431640625,
        324.4901123046875,
        520.1188354492188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ν −ω⊤x ≥0, ∀x ∈X.",
      "bbox": [
        375.36065673828125,
        518.9287719726562,
        476.9999084472656,
        530.7299194335938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hence, checking the feasibility of ν is equivalent to check",
      "bbox": [
        306.72027587890625,
        530.468505859375,
        545.822021484375,
        543.7586669921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the non-negativity of the polynomial ν −ω⊤x in the set X.",
      "bbox": [
        306.72027587890625,
        541.5087280273438,
        543.2109375,
        554.7988891601562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remark 3 The",
      "bbox": [
        306.72027587890625,
        562.71826171875,
        369.4638671875,
        576.5165405273438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
