      "text": "the following to efﬁciently solve the semi-inﬁnite linear",
      "bbox": [
        306.7203369140625,
        629.4044189453125,
        545.9160766601562,
        641.56884765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "programming problem (29) through convex optimization.",
